sequenceDiagram
    participant A as Order A
    participant I as Inventory
    participant B as Order B
    A->>I: Check stock
    I-->>A: One unit available
    Note over A: Check result recorded
    B->>I: Check stock
    I-->>B: One unit available
    B->>I: Buy final unit
    I-->>B: Purchase accepted
    Note over I: Available stock is now zero
    A->>A: Obtain quote using saved check
    Note over A: No stock was held for A
